What this licence covers (data, recorded games, reports and model weights)

- data/                          dataset files: sample game logs and imitation
                                 records (data/samples/), split manifests
                                 (data/splits/)
- demo_hex_board/sample_games.js recorded demo games
- reports/                       training, data and analysis reports and
                                 figures (reports/training/, reports/data/,
                                 reports/analysis/, reports/figures/)
- models/                        trained model weights (models/final/*.pt,
                                 models/checkpoints/*.pt)

Why two names: the data was generated by Naz Akgül's code playing against
agents by Adyansh Gupta, whose agents acted as the expert/teacher and labelled
the moves. The model weights were trained on that data.

